<font face="verdana, arial, helvetica" size="2" class="nf"  color="#000000"><b> CVS Commit (09/10/03) + Tarball + diff</b></font>
<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="1" class="sf">
<b> Posted by: [<a href="/forums/member.php?s=296aa7e3be9edabb51ad58e4d1ba27ff&action=mailform&userid=96">Zaphod</a>] on 09-10-2003 @ 07:52 AM</b>
